  "summary": "In The Gambia there is no single national university placement system; applicants apply to the university directly, usually through its online portal. The University of The Gambia asks for WASSCE or GCE O-Level with at least five credits including English Language and Mathematics, with a separate route for mature students. The National Accreditation and Quality Assurance Authority (NAQAA) accredits programmes and registers tertiary institutions.",
